  wiringEvents:
  - EV-DE-02
  - Unstable telemetry signal
  howToPlay: Connect each color to its twin. Cables can't cross!
  lesson: Real spacecraft give every system its own path, and important ones get a backup path, so one broken wire can't turn everything off.
